  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人際溝通大解鎖",
    "sub_ename": "INTERPERSONAL RELATIONSHIPS AND COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨於提升學生對於人際溝通議題認識，包含了心理學與人際溝通的重要理論，例如薩提爾溝通模式、人際溝通分析理論與應用。\n介紹溝通理論之餘，透過生活化的上課方式，將理論轉化為日常生活中實用的技巧。藉由小組討論、短片賞析和人際溝通實作應用，協助學生未來在職場關係、伴侶關係，以及家庭生活中，提升自己的人際溝通能力。\n預計介紹的議題有伴侶溝通、家庭溝通、職場溝通、以及人際說服與影響力等。",
    "describe_eh": "The course aims to enhance students' understanding of interpersonal communication issues which include psychological theories and theories of interpersonal communication, such as the Satir communication model and Transactional Analysis theory.\nIn addition to introducing communication theory, the course also provides practical skills in daily life through different teaching methods. For instance, group discussions, short film appreciation and practicing interpersonal communication skills. The course aims to help students improve their interpersonal communication skills in workplaces, partner relationships, and family life.\nTopics expected to be introduced include partner communication, family communication, workplace communication, and interpersonal persuasion and influence.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
